  "coverage": {
    "notes": [
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "SALARY MODEL: conglobated retribuzione globale (TABELLA C - Lavoratori Non Conviventi, Art. 14 c. 1 lett. b CCNL 28/10/2025). Hourly rates from the official Domina salary table PDF (TABELLA-minimi-retributivi-2026.pdf, effective 01/01/2026). Monthly base_salary = hourly rate x 40 x 52 / 12 (chiarimento a verbale 1). Source is signatory employer association - primary source."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "TAX SECTOR: lavoro-domestico (TaxSector.LAVORO_DOMESTICO). Flat per-hour INPS contributions from INPS Circ. 9/2026. A household employer is not a withholding agent: it is not among the sostituti d'imposta of art. 23 c. 1 D.P.R. 600/1973 (art. 33 c. 1 D.Lgs. 33/2025 from 2027), so the engine withholds no IRPEF or surtax and pays no trattamento integrativo, ulteriore detrazione or somma esente."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "HOURLY DIVISOR: 173.33 = 40 x 52 / 12 to the cent: 40 h/week contractual maximum for non conviventi (Art. 14 c. 1 lett. b CCNL 28/10/2025) and chiarimento a verbale 1. Convivente and non-convivente are independent pay scales (different tables, different hourly divisors)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "BASE SALARY: computed as hourly_rate x 40 x 52 / 12, rounded to the cent. Dividing it by the hourly divisor 173.33 recovers the Tabella C hourly rate to the cent."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "ADDITIONAL MONTHS: 13 (tredicesima mensilita, Art. 39 CCNL 28/10/2025). No quattordicesima."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "SENIORITY: biennale (24 months), maximum 7 scatti (Art. 37). Per-level amounts = 4% x the monthly minimum (hourly x 40 x 52 / 12). Amounts frozen at 2026 values - future ISTAT tranches require manual update."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "APPRENTICESHIP: none. Domestic workers excluded from D.lgs. 81/2015 Art. 47 apprenticeship."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "D/DS function allowance: not applicable for non-convivente (TABELLA C shows only hourly rates, no separate indennità column). D/DS hourly rates already reflect the seniority grade."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "CNEL code H501 confirmed: lavoro-economia.it explicitly lists 'CCNL Lavoro Domestico (Colf e Badanti) [Cnel: H501]'. Also confirmed via kitech.it. CNEL archive verification not attempted (had returned 404 previously)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "SINGLE PERIOD 2026-01-01. Pre-2026 tranches out of scope. Post-2026 CCNL 2025-2028 tranches not yet modelled: +30 on BS from Jan 2027, +15 from Jan 2028, +15 from Sep 2028 (other levels proportional — exact amounts require official ASSINDATCOLF/DOMINA table for those periods).",
        "capability": "base_salary",
        "monetary_impact": "yes",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "tranches_from_2027",
          "applies_when": {
            "effective_from": "2027-01-01"
          },
          "remediation": "Add the 2027 and 2028 tranches from the official ASSINDATCOLF/DOMINA tables."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Seniority amounts frozen at 2026 base. Future ISTAT adjustments will raise base_salary but amount_by_level will need manual update.",
        "capability": "seniority",
        "monetary_impact": "unknown",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "seniority_frozen_at_2026",
          "applies_when": {
            "effective_from": "2027-01-01"
          },
          "remediation": "Update the seniority amounts with each ISTAT adjustment of the minimum tables."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "Livello Unico (hourly 5.83) is a special sub-under-18 level excluded from this model."
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "CAS.SA.COLF: contributi di assistenza contrattuale of Art. 54 c. 2, 0,06 EUR per paid hour, 0,02 withheld from the worker and 0,04 paid by the employer, charged on the contributable hours of the run."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "A non-convivente on 6 or more hours a day with continuous presence is owed the meal or, when it is not given, an indennita equal to its valore convenzionale (Art. 14 c. 8; Tabella F 2026: 2,33 per meal). The request carries no fact on daily hours, presence or meals given, so the engine pays none.",
        "capability": "base_salary",
        "monetary_impact": "unknown",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "meal_indennity",
          "applies_when": {
            "run_kinds": [
              "regular",
              "termination"
            ]
          },
          "remediation": "Add a fact for the days owed a meal not given and pay the Tabella F value for them."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "The INPS contributions of the tredicesima are paid on the hours of the year: INPS bands them on the paga oraria effettiva, which spreads the tredicesima over the hours, so the tredicesima run charges no INPS hours. The Cas.Sa.Colf contribution of Art. 54 c. 2 is charged on the contributable hours the run states, a tredicesima run too: no bundled source says whether the tredicesima carries hours of its own for it.",
        "capability": "assistance_contribution",
        "monetary_impact": "unknown",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "extra_month_hours",
          "applies_when": {
            "run_kinds": [
              "thirteenth"
            ]
          },
          "remediation": "Source from the Cas.Sa.Colf rules whether the tredicesima carries contributable hours and set them for extra-month runs."
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "info",
        "text": "SICKNESS (Art. 27): INPS pays no indemnity to domestic workers; the employer pays 50% of the retribuzione globale di fatto up to the third day and 100% from the fourth, for at most 8, 10 or 15 days in the 365 days that end on the sick day, within a comporto of 10, 45 or 180 days, for up to 6 months of seniority, up to 2 years and over 2 years. A sick day is a thirtieth of the monthly pay (chiarimento a verbale 2)."
      },
      {
        "kind": "simplification",
        "text": "Art. 27 c. 6: the comporto is 50% longer for an oncological illness certified by the ASL. The request does not say whether an episode is oncological, so the engine keeps the ordinary comporto.",
        "capability": "sickness",
        "monetary_impact": "unknown",
        "limitation": {
          "variant": "oncological_comporto",
          "applies_when": {
            "trigger": "outside_input"
          },
          "remediation": "Add a fact for an oncological sickness episode and lengthen its comporto by 50%."
        }
      }
    ]
  },
