          "page": "37-38, 56",
          "section": "Art. 27 cc. 4, 5, 7 (malattia); chiarimento a verbale 2 (giorni di calendario in trentesimi)",
          "quote": "decorre in caso di malattia la retribuzione globale di fatto per un massimo di 8, 10, 15 giorni complessivi nell'anno"
        },
        "extraction": {
          "method": "ai",
          "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
          "extraction_timestamp": "2026-10-12T12:00:00Z",
          "verification_status": "unverified",
          "effective_from": "2025-11-01"
        },
        "transformation": "INPS pays domestic workers no sickness indemnity, so the employer pays the CCNL rate: 50% up to the third consecutive day (the carenza) and 100% from the fourth, for at most 8, 10 or 15 days and within a comporto of 10, 45 or 180 days, for up to 6 months of seniority, from 6 months to 2 years and over 2 years (bands from 0, 6 and 24 months). Readings: 'nell'anno' of c. 7 is taken as the period of 365 days of c. 5, and the 365 days 'decorrenti dall'evento' as the year that ends on the sick day; a day past the paid days is unpaid; the daily pay is a thirtieth of the monthly pay (chiarimento a verbale 2: 'giorni di calendario' are thirtieths, 'esempio: malattia')."
      }
    }
